{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"246da0e6-0ebd-47e9-9d31-7a54a79b8a47","title":"Marginalia and approval flags","desc":"Two conventions: sticky notes for our own reactions, a frontmatter flag for vendor sign-off.","updated":1788393600000,"created":1788393600000,"tags":["meta","photography","writing-system"],"custom":{},"fname":"notes.photos.notation","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"43e2de43f2739b6ebb14baedc05f8a60","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.photos.notation","id":"246da0e6-0ebd-47e9-9d31-7a54a79b8a47","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.photos.notation","id":"246da0e6-0ebd-47e9-9d31-7a54a79b8a47","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.photography","alias":"photography","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.photography"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.photos.notation","id":"246da0e6-0ebd-47e9-9d31-7a54a79b8a47","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.writing-system","alias":"writing-system","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.writing-system"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.photos.notation","id":"246da0e6-0ebd-47e9-9d31-7a54a79b8a47","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.three-kinds-of-page","alias":"Three kinds of page","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":11,"offset":2075},"end":{"line":66,"column":60,"offset":2124},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.three-kinds-of-page"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.photos","id":"4ae2c7ca-0db8-4486-b1d3-7027f71420d3","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":29,"offset":3284},"end":{"line":66,"column":67,"offset":3322},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.photos.notation"}],"anchors":{"sticky-notes":{"type":"header","text":"Sticky notes","value":"sticky-notes","line":21,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-approval-flag":{"type":"header","text":"The approval flag","value":"the-approval-flag","line":58,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"4ae2c7ca-0db8-4486-b1d3-7027f71420d3","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"marginalia-and-approval-flags\">Marginalia and approval flags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#marginalia-and-approval-flags\"></a></h1>\n<p>A source page records what someone else did. Our reactions to it are a\ndifferent kind of writing, and if they're mixed into the summary the page\nstops being a reliable record of the source — six months later nobody can\ntell which sentence came from the photographer and which came from us.</p>\n<p>So reactions go in the margin, visibly, attributed, and dated.</p>\n<h2 id=\"sticky-notes\">Sticky notes<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sticky-notes\"></a></h2>\n<p>Raw HTML passes through Dendron's publish pipeline, so an <code>&#x3C;aside></code> works and\ncan be styled and filtered later:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#x3C;</span>aside</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>sticky<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">data-who</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>rk<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">data-date</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>2026-09-03<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\nThe overhead rig assumes a flat object. Wafer boxes aren't flat.\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#x3C;/</span>aside</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Drop one anywhere — mid-section is the point, it should sit next to the\nsentence it argues with. <code>data-who</code> is initials, <code>data-date</code> is ISO. Both\nmatter: an unattributed sticky note is indistinguishable from the summary it\nwas meant to be separate from.</p>\n<p>Styling lives in the site's custom CSS, not inline, so the whole class can be\nsuppressed for a public build:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\"><span class=\"token class\">.sticky</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">border-left</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token unit\">px</span> solid <span class=\"token hexcode color\">#d9a441</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">background</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token hexcode color\">#fdf6e6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">padding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.6</span><span class=\"token unit\">rem</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.9</span><span class=\"token unit\">rem</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">margin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token unit\">rem</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">font-size</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.92</span><span class=\"token unit\">em</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\"><span class=\"token class\">.sticky</span><span class=\"token pseudo-element\">::before</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">content</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">attr</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data-who<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token string\">\" · \"</span> <span class=\"token function\">attr</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data-date<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> block<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">font-variant</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> small-caps<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">letter-spacing</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.04</span><span class=\"token unit\">em</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.65</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">margin-bottom</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token unit\">rem</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"the-approval-flag\">The approval flag<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-approval-flag\"></a></h2>\n<p><code>vendor_approved</code> is a boolean in frontmatter. It means one thing only: a\nnamed external vendor has agreed in writing that we may research or adopt this\nwork more deeply. It does not mean we like it, and it is not a rating.</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">vendor_approved</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">vendor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Studio name\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">approved_on</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token datetime number\">2026-09-14</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>A bare boolean loses the provenance that makes it worth anything, hence the\ntwo companion fields. Default is <code>false</code>; absent counts as <code>false</code>.</p>\n<p>Dendron's lookup searches filenames, titles and tags — it won't filter on a\ncustom frontmatter field. So when the flag flips to <code>true</code>, also add\n<code>vendor-approved</code> to <code>tags</code>. The frontmatter is the truth, the tag is the\nindex, and they have to be changed together.</p>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25\">Three kinds of page</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">meta (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">photography (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">writing-system (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/4ae2c7ca-0db8-4486-b1d3-7027f71420d3\">Photographing the exhibition</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","title":"Notes","desc":"Ideas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta"],"custom